---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EntityArticle from '../../components/v2/templates/EntityArticle.astro';
import { entityImages } from '../../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../../utils/seo';
const pageSEO = getPageSEO('equipment-basic-stove');
---

<BaseLayout
  pageId="equipment-basic-stove"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment/' }, { label: 'Stoves', href: '/equipment/stoves/' }, { label: pageSEO.h1 }]}
>
<EntityArticle
  title={pageSEO.h1}
  kicker="Equipment profile"
  intro="The Basic Stove is a named cooking-equipment entry in the Karinderya Stove directory."
  heroImage={entityImages.basicStove}
  tableOfContents
  nextPage={{ label: 'Standard Stove', href: '/equipment/standard-stove/' }}
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Equipment Hub', href: '/equipment/', description: 'Browse restaurant equipment categories and usage guidance.' },
    { label: 'Stoves Directory', href: '/equipment/stoves/', description: 'Browse every Stove entry currently covered by the Wiki.' },
    { label: 'Cooking and Serving Guide', href: '/guides/cooking-and-serving/', description: 'Follow cooking as part of the complete restaurant service workflow.' },
    { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/', description: 'Learn the main restaurant systems and how they connect.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="short-answer">Short Answer</h2>
  <p>Basic Stove is one of the stove names visible in dated Karinderya placement footage. It appears as an owned cooking item that can be selected from the Stoves inventory.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>The available capture confirms the item name and its placement under the Stoves category. It does not establish a permanent price, cooking time, capacity, or unlock condition.</p>

  <h2 id="how-it-works">How It Works</h2>
  <p>Select the Basic Stove from owned inventory when it is available, then place it through the current customization interface. Follow the live cooking prompts for actual operation.</p>

  <h2 id="usage">How Players Obtain It</h2>
  <p>A permanent acquisition route has not been verified for this version. Check the tutorial, owned inventory, and current shop interface rather than relying on an old price or unlock claim.</p>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Keep cooking equipment within a clearly organized kitchen work area.</li>
    <li>Review ingredient and recipe information alongside the cooking workflow.</li>
    <li>Use the Stove directory to move between individual equipment entries.</li>
  </ul>
</EntityArticle>
</BaseLayout>
